// Contexto: workspace Log Analytics con tablas App*. Ejecutar bloques separados.
// Revisado documentalmente; NO ejecutado. No mezclar columnas con esquema requests.

// W1. Fallos por operación/status. count() cuenta registros observados.
AppRequests
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30m) and Success == false
| summarize total = count() by Name, ResultCode
| order by total desc

// W2. Excepciones del workspace.
AppExceptions
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30m)
| summarize total = count() by ExceptionType, OuterMessage
| order by total desc

// W3. Logs de aplicación.
AppTraces
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30m) and SeverityLevel >= 2
| project TimeGenerated, SeverityLevel, Message, OperationId
| order by TimeGenerated desc
| take 100

// W4. Dependencias; DurationMs está en milisegundos.
AppDependencies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30m)
| summarize fallos = countif(Success == false), p95_ms = percentile(DurationMs, 95) by Target
| order by fallos desc

// W5. Reconstrucción de operación dentro del ámbito autorizado.
union withsource=Tabla AppRequests, AppDependencies, AppExceptions, AppTraces
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30m)
| where OperationId == "REEMPLAZAR_OPERATION_ID"
| project TimeGenerated, Tabla, OperationId, Name, ResultCode, ExceptionType, Message, OuterMessage
| order by TimeGenerated asc
